{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2006-common-biology-28","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2006,"subject":"biology","number":28,"points":null,"unitId":"circulation","unitLabel":"순환·혈액","topic":"혈관","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["circulation"],"stem":"사람의위는음식이들어오면염산을분비한다. 그림은위샘에\n있는벽세포가염산을분비하는기작을나타낸것이다.\n위그림에관한설명이나추론중옳은것을<보기>에서고른\n것은?\n<보\n기>\nㄱ. 벽세포의세포질은분비할염산이농축되어산성화된다.\nㄴ. 벽세포에서염산이분비되는과정에는ATP가소모된다.\n＋/K\n＋펌프가H\n＋를위내강으로내보내면, Cl\n－는위내강\nㄷ. H\n으로방출된다.\nㄹ. 염산이위내강으로분비될때모세혈관의혈액은pH가\n일정하게유지된다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":697,"height":349,"region":0,"bbox":[29.955,49.86,278.8,139.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2006-common-biology-28/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":772,"height":309,"region":0,"bbox":[13.955,250.66,308.8,123.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2006-common-biology-28/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":8,"sourceRect":[429.645,151.34,758.256,559.408],"width":328.611,"height":408.068,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[29.955,49.86,278.8,139.6],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[13.955,250.66,308.8,123.6],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"28. 사람의위는음식이들어오면염산을분비한다. 그림은위샘에","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.54,11.035],"spans":[{"text":"28.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,12.865,1